<< /A 36 0 R /Alt (Flowchart detailing steps for cardiovascular measurement analysis: rest measurements, signal cleaning, segmenting RR intervals, HRV calculations, dataset creation, selecting machine learning algorithms, data split, hyperparameter tuning, model training, validation, and explainable AI analysis.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 28 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
